{"3030470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You Belong in the Stars", "steam_appid": 3030470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/104a7f8f632422149acbf673bd76e71b.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras_big/104a7f8f632422149acbf673bd76e71b.avif?t=1782393727 width=800 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the fractured world of <strong><i>You Belong in the Stars</i></strong>, where you travel from solar system to solar system in an open world galaxy, exploring ot all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/068426c243b642f6b911aaaf1005e07a.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras_big/068426c243b642f6b911aaaf1005e07a.avif?t=1782393727 width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in dogfights with smaller spacecraft or pilot larger cruisers. Choose from a wide selection of ships, each with unique combat abilities and utilities to attack, defend, or even exit your ship to fight enemies inside space stations or other vessels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/ff08c4613b091bcb188b08fcc35ff57c.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras_big/ff08c4613b091bcb188b08fcc35ff57c.avif?t=1782393727 width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing quests earns you money to spend on ships and equipment, while also improving your reputation with the quest-giving organization. Meanwhile, your target’s opinion of you worsens, eventually forcing them to take action against you. The reputation system in <i>You Belong in the Stars</i> determines whether organizations will be friendly or hostile towards you and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/4232c93b6aff07fa49dc123f2ef846a1.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras_big/4232c93b6aff07fa49dc123f2ef846a1.avif?t=1782393727 width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You Belong in the Stars</i> gives you the freedom to explore its vast solar and star systems, but traveling between them is no simple task. Or maybe it will be I didnt decide yet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/35f50329389bfd50b413cdf7cbc2a564.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras_big/35f50329389bfd50b413cdf7cbc2a564.avif?t=1782393727 width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early access wont feature all of these, but the final release will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 50+ unique ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of these ships have walkable interiors that you can seamlessly enter and exit on foot or in a vehicle that fits through the doors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ origins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galaxy with simulated economy that the player can interact by protecting or raiding trade routes etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a large amount and variety of quests:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dogfighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >securing locations through a shootout outside of your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving friendly ships in emergencies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some special quests that won't fit these categories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mining</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/104a7f8f632422149acbf673bd76e71b.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras_big/104a7f8f632422149acbf673bd76e71b.avif?t=1782393727 width=800 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the fractured world of <strong><i>You Belong in the Stars</i></strong>, where you travel from solar system to solar system in an open world galaxy, exploring ot all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/068426c243b642f6b911aaaf1005e07a.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras_big/068426c243b642f6b911aaaf1005e07a.avif?t=1782393727 width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in dogfights with smaller spacecraft or pilot larger cruisers. Choose from a wide selection of ships, each with unique combat abilities and utilities to attack, defend, or even exit your ship to fight enemies inside space stations or other vessels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/ff08c4613b091bcb188b08fcc35ff57c.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras_big/ff08c4613b091bcb188b08fcc35ff57c.avif?t=1782393727 width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing quests earns you money to spend on ships and equipment, while also improving your reputation with the quest-giving organization. Meanwhile, your target’s opinion of you worsens, eventually forcing them to take action against you. The reputation system in <i>You Belong in the Stars</i> determines whether organizations will be friendly or hostile towards you and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/4232c93b6aff07fa49dc123f2ef846a1.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras_big/4232c93b6aff07fa49dc123f2ef846a1.avif?t=1782393727 width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You Belong in the Stars</i> gives you the freedom to explore its vast solar and star systems, but traveling between them is no simple task. Or maybe it will be I didnt decide yet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030470/extras/35f50329389bfd50b413cdf7cbc2a564.avif?t=1782393727\" data-big-src=ht